#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:10
#: d246281933be45a59b189050b70e2a25
msgid "Soaring SITL with Silent Wings"
msgstr "使用 Silent Wings 进行滑翔 SITL 仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:12
#: 59ca6f8a441641c78c52ffe468d790a4
msgid ""
"Silent Wings is a simulator that focuses specifically on sailplanes. In "
"spite of being somewhat dated by now, as of April 2019 it still provides "
"some of the most accurate simulations of sailplane flight and details of "
"atmospheric phenomena that matter for it, such as thermal lifecycles, "
"distribution of thermal and ridge lift over terrain, their dependence on "
"weather, etc. This makes it a great tool for testing various aspects of "
"autonomous soaring."
msgstr ""
"Silent Wings 是一款专注于滑翔机的仿真器。尽管如今已略显过时，但截至 2019 年 4 "
"月，它仍提供业界最精确的滑翔机飞行仿真，以及与之相关的大气现象细节——例如热流生命周期、热流和山脊升力在地形上的分布及其对天气的依赖等。这使其成为测试各类自主滑翔功能的绝佳工具。"

