msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:19
#: 74d7805091724d1eaf40be97a8e42a08
msgid ""
"This document describes how to run ArduPlane software-in-the-loop (SITL) "
"simulation with Silent Wings. Whether you are working on a soaring "
"controller for a specific type of lift (e.g., thermal lift) or a cross-"
"country sailplane navigation strategy, you may find it useful to test your "
"approach in simulation. This is especially true for long-range navigation, "
"whose evaluation in the open world is logistically difficult and expensive. "
"SITL testing allows you to do exactly that by compiling ArduPlane code into "
"a special binary that can run on your regular computer, receive sensor data "
"from a simulator running on the same or different machine, and send inputs "
"back to the simulator in order to control a simulated sailplane."
msgstr ""
"本文档介绍如何结合 Silent Wings 运行 ArduPlane "
"软件在环（SITL）仿真。无论您正在研究特定类型升力（如热流升力）的滑翔控制器，还是跨国滑翔机导航策略，都可能会发现在仿真中测试方案非常有价值。尤其对于远程导航而言，在真实环境中评估在后勤上既困难又昂贵。SITL"
" 测试正好可以解决这一问题——通过将 ArduPlane "
"代码编译成可在普通计算机上运行的专用二进制文件，接收来自同一台或不同机器上仿真器的传感器数据，并向仿真器发送控制指令，以操控仿真滑翔机。"

