#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:28
#: 82a57a085fbb43e19b28102c43af5b3d
msgid ""
"**Install** `Silent Wings "
"<https://www.silentwings.no/a/download/downloadPage/simulator>`_ **and at "
"least one** `scenery package for it "
"<https://www.silentwings.no/download/scenery/>`_ **.** The 2-week demo "
