#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:85
#: 06c543ca358343dcbefd6a6af55a18ae
msgid "Running Silent Wings SITL"
msgstr "运行 Silent Wings SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:87
#: a8940dce09c043a184f6d79bf10edb09
msgid ""
"**Launch Silent Wings.** In Silent Wings' *Flight Planner* section, on the "
"*Aircraft* tab choose a sailplane. Note that each sailplane model has "
"distinct characteristics, and ArduPlane needs a parameter (.param) file for "
"that model in order to be aware of them. We provide a `parameter file for "
"Rolladen-Schneider LS-8b "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/SilentWings/Params/Rolladen-"
"Schneider-LS8b.param>`_, and this is the sailplane we recommend as a start."
msgstr ""
"**启动 Silent Wings。** 在 Silent Wings "
"的「飞行计划」部分，在「飞机」选项卡中选择一款滑翔机。请注意，每种滑翔机模型具有不同特性，ArduPlane "
"需要该模型对应的参数（.param）文件才能识别这些特性。我们提供了 `Rolladen-Schneider LS-8b 的参数文件 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/SilentWings/Params/Rolladen-"
"Schneider-LS8b.param>`_，推荐以此滑翔机作为起点。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:89
#: 502d2c9b620145d2837f7e23da729d43
msgid ""
"Set weather and air traffic conditions on the *Weather* and *Traffic* tabs "
"respectively. On the *Location* tab, choose the map and starting location, "
"and note its GPS coordinates, altitude, and heading. You will need this "
"information when launching SITL. Then click the *Fly Now!* button on the "
"bottom right. The game is going to start in a paused state. Keep it paused "
"for now."
msgstr ""
"在「天气」和「交通」选项卡中分别设置天气和空中交通条件。在「位置」选项卡中选择地图和起始位置，并记下其 GPS 坐标、海拔和航向——启动 SITL "
"时需要这些信息。然后点击右下角的「立即飞行！」按钮，游戏将以暂停状态启动，请暂时保持暂停。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:96
#: 38e02b9e197c452dae121731af492a3e
msgid ""
"**Launch ArduPlane SITL.** To do so, open a Cygwin64 terminal, switch to "
"your ArduPilot repository's root directory, and run ::"
msgstr "**启动 ArduPlane SITL。** 为此，打开 Cygwin64 终端，切换到 ArduPilot 仓库根目录，并运行 ::"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:100
#: 195017c4e8d4403287712d3b05a9326a
msgid "e.g., ::"
msgstr "例如 ::"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:104
#: 1cef17036ce34353aa222bbf2617b16f
msgid ""
"Here, `<lat>` and `<lon>` are the start location's latitude and longitude "
"that you noted down when launching Silent Wings, with a \"-\" sign if "
"latitude is S or longitude is W. **However, `<alt>` should be the elevation "
"of the start location's terrain above sea level, even if you chose to start "
"in the air.** To determine it, subtract the starting altitude you noted down"
" earlier (it is AGL) from the altitde you see in the top left corner of the "
"Silent Wings window (it is MSL) when the mission starts. The result is the "
"`<alt>` that you need to pass to the SITL. Thus, note that for the mission "
"in the above screenshot, `<alt>` =216, not 800. `<yaw>` is the initial "
"heading you picked for the Silent Wings mission."
msgstr ""
"其中，`<lat>` 和 `<lon>` 是您在启动 Silent Wings 时记下的起始位置纬度和经度，若纬度为南纬或经度为西经则加「-」号。**但"
" `<alt>` 应为起始位置地形的海拔高度（MSL），即使您选择在空中起飞也是如此。** "
"确定方法：用您之前记下的起始海拔（AGL，即离地高度）减去任务开始时 Silent Wings "
"窗口左上角显示的海拔值（MSL，即平均海平面高度），所得结果即为需要传给 SITL 的 `<alt>`。因此请注意，上图截图所示任务中，`<alt>` "
"应为 216 而非 800。`<yaw>` 是您为 Silent Wings 任务选择的初始航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:107
#: 14758c89a46e42f8a47f6239f5c7ce67
msgid ""
"We recommend start locations with near-zero terrain elevation above the sea "
"level, because the SITL flavor of ArduPlane occasionally behaves quirky if "
"the simulated aircraft descends below the home location's `<alt>`."
msgstr ""
"建议选择地形海拔接近零的起始位置，因为当仿真飞机下降到起始位置的 `<alt>` 以下时，ArduPlane 的 SITL 版本偶尔会出现异常行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:109
#: aba676f4479c4005b2831864e42aa5e5
msgid ""
"At this point, the SITL should be waiting for a connection to the ground "
"control station (Mission Planner):"
msgstr "此时，SITL 应正在等待连接地面站（Mission Planner）："

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:116
#: 6d06e4a6be654ae9823333ddc353e1b6
msgid ""
"**Launch Mission Planner, connect a joystick, and** `set up the joystick in "
"Mission Planner <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-joystick.html>`_ "
"to configure its roll, pitch, and yaw axes (other axes will be ignored by "
"Silent Wings)."
msgstr ""
"**启动 Mission Planner，连接摇杆，并** `在 Mission Planner 中设置摇杆 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-joystick.html>`_ "
"以配置其横滚、俯仰和偏航轴（其他轴将被 Silent Wings 忽略）。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:119
#: 7a7efbe034704067b0718365cbd893f9
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, Mission Planner appears to forget joystick settings when it "
"is shut down, so this step has to be redone every time Mission Planner is "
"restarted or the joystick is reconnected. Alternatively, you can try "
"controlling the plane using your keyboard."
msgstr ""
"遗憾的是，Mission Planner 关闭后似乎会遗忘摇杆设置，因此每次重启 Mission Planner "
"或重新连接摇杆时都需要重新进行此步骤。或者，您也可以尝试用键盘控制飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:123
#: 4774a92a5cde40018585db8b165a750f
msgid ""
"**Have Mission Planner establish connections to Silent Wings and ArduPlane "
"SITL.** To do so, in Mission Planner's top right corner choose TCP, click "
"*Connect*, enter the IP address where Silent Wings is running (127.0.0.1 if "
"it is on the same machine) in the window that pops up, and enter 5760 as the"
" port number in the next window. Wait until the *Connect Mavlink* window "
"disappears, all parameters are copied over, and all calibration messages in "
"Mission Planner's HUD disappear. You should see Mission Planner's HUD report"
" that the GPS has lock and the airspeed sensor reads a value around 0."
msgstr ""
"**让 Mission Planner 建立与 Silent Wings 和 ArduPlane SITL 的连接。** 为此，在 Mission "
"Planner 右上角选择 TCP，点击「连接」，在弹出窗口中输入运行 Silent Wings 的 IP 地址（若在同一台机器上则为 "
"127.0.0.1），并在下一个窗口中输入端口号 5760。等待「Connect Mavlink」窗口消失、所有参数复制完毕，以及 Mission "
"Planner HUD 中所有校准消息消失。此时您应能在 Mission Planner HUD 中看到 GPS 已锁定且空速传感器读数约为 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:125
#: df3f50dc586d4d1b984a70dfe349766b
msgid "Now ArduPlane is ready to control the plane in Silent Wings."
msgstr "此时 ArduPlane 已准备好在 Silent Wings 中控制飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:132
#: bb0815e00cec4e329e541cc1da9863aa
msgid ""
"**Load the parameter file for the chosen Silent Wings sailplane into "
"ArduPlane via Mission Planner.** *(This step needs to be done only the first"
" time you fly a given sailplane model in Silent Wings.)* To do so, go to "
"Mission Planner's *CONFIG/TUNING* tab, choose *Full Parameter List* on the "
"left, click *Load from file* on the right, locate the parameter file, and "
"click *Write Params* on the right. After doing this, terminate ArduPlane "
"SITL in the Cygwin64 terminal, close Mission Planner, and repeat steps 2 and"
" 4."
msgstr ""
"**通过 Mission Planner 将所选 Silent Wings 滑翔机的参数文件加载到 ArduPlane 中。** *（此步骤仅需在首次在"
" Silent Wings 中飞行特定滑翔机型号时执行。）* 为此，进入 Mission Planner "
"的「CONFIG/TUNING」选项卡，在左侧选择「Full Parameter List」，在右侧点击「Load from "
"file」，找到参数文件，然后点击右侧的「Write Params」。完成后，在 Cygwin64 终端中终止 ArduPlane SITL，关闭 "
"Mission Planner，然后重复步骤 2 和步骤 4。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:139
#: 498a02addf63400bb8425ffe104e3472
msgid ""
"**If desired, load a mission in Mission Planner.** To do so, go to Mission "
"Planner's *FLIGHT PLAN* tab, click *Load WP File* on the right, locate the "
"mission file, and click *Write WPs*. We provide a file for a `test mission "
"near Starmoen, Norway "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/SilentWings/Missions/Starmoen.waypoints>`_."
msgstr ""
"**如需加载任务，请在 Mission Planner 中操作。** 为此，进入 Mission Planner 的「FLIGHT "
"PLAN」选项卡，在右侧点击「Load WP File」，找到任务文件，然后点击「Write WPs」。我们提供了一个 `挪威 Starmoen "
"附近的测试任务文件 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/SilentWings/Missions/Starmoen.waypoints>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:146
#: ad5e089611894cddb8aea8e4e344ee29
msgid ""
"**Start flying!** By now, everything is ready to commence the flight. In the"
" Silent Wings window, hit the \"p\" key to unpause the simulation. You "
"should see airspeed, altitude, and AHRS readings in Mission Planner's HUD "
"closely match those in Silent Wings' top right and left corners. To have "
"Silent Wings' sailplane follow the loaded mission, switch the flight mode to"
" *Auto* in Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"**开始飞行！** 至此，一切准备就绪。在 Silent Wings 窗口中按「p」键取消暂停仿真。您应能看到 Mission Planner HUD "
"中的空速、海拔和 AHRS 读数与 Silent Wings 右上角和左上角的数据高度吻合。若要让 Silent Wings "
"中的滑翔机执行已加载的任务，请在 Mission Planner 中将飞行模式切换为「Auto」。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:153
